[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 4620.39, "timestamp": "01:17:00", "text": "所以，是当地时间。目前的情况就像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4623.27, "timestamp": "01:17:03", "text": "10:27"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4626.79, "timestamp": "01:17:06", "text": "下午为我。对，它在左上角。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4630.87, "timestamp": "01:17:10", "text": "我的直播画面左上角。哦，对了，我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4633.03, "timestamp": "01:17:13", "text": "现在必须解决这个问题。我们的服务器"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4636.47, "timestamp": "01:17:16", "text": "时间。它就在那里。现在看这里。哦，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4640.07, "timestamp": "01:17:20", "text": "是的。它坏了。 [笑声]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4642.47, "timestamp": "01:17:22", "text": "不是印度人。是的，这是印度标准。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4645.669, "timestamp": "01:17:25", "text": "时间。印度标准时间为格林尼治标准时间 5:30。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4650.55, "timestamp": "01:17:30", "text": "呃，5点加5点30分。是的。 5小时30分钟"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4652.39, "timestamp": "01:17:32", "text": "前方。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4654.95, "timestamp": "01:17:34", "text": "是的。这已破了。印度时间"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4658.63, "timestamp": "01:17:38", "text": "日本时间、中国时间、太平洋时间"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4662.39, "timestamp": "01:17:42", "text": "昨天。哦，我们得好好整顿一下这家伙。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4670.07, "timestamp": "01:17:50", "text": "但是，我得弄清楚为什么会这样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4678.229, "timestamp": "01:17:58", "text": "即使是批评。"}]